---
description: Orthographic diorama shader and Early-Z cutaway rules
globs: "**/*.gdshader"
alwaysApply: false
---
- Use global shader uniform `global uniform vec3 player_world_pos;` updated via `RenderingServer.global_shader_parameter_set(&"player_world_pos", pos)`.
- Apply dither cutaway `discard` ONLY to foreground occluder walls/columns, never globally across a room, to preserve Early-Z depth rejection.
- Prefer 8x8 Bayer or world-indexed blue-noise dither thresholds for clean orthographic diorama readability.
